  "description": "Furuya's not interested in the living, he's got zombies on the brain! When Furuya's cat dies, he decides he's going to try and bring it back to life. In the process, he stumbles across a girl who is involved in an accident and turns into a real zombie! What's Furuya going to do now that the thing he loves the most is right in front of his eyes?<br><br>\n(Source: FUNimation)",
  "siteUrl": "https://anilist.co/anime/11499",
  "characters": [
    {
      "role": "MAIN",
      "node": {
        "id": 32884,
        "name": {
          "full": "Rea Sanka",
          "native": "散華礼弥",
          "alternative": []
        },
        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b32884-8Yei2CrGNNwL.jpg"
        },
        "description": "__Height__: 161 cm (5'3\")\n__School__: Sanka Girls' High School\n__Class__: First Year Student\n\nRea is the heroine of the story who steals and drinks some of the zombie potion made by [Chihiro](https://anilist.co/character/36494/Furuya-Chihiro) in an attempt to commit suicide because of the sheltered life she lives. She fails in the attempt but she resurrects as zombie when she accidentally falls of a cliff and dies. As a zombie, she lives together with Chihiro in order to know how it feels to become free from [her father](https://anilist.co/character/43297/Sanka-Danichirou)'s chains.\n\nRea is friendly with everyone at the shrine, including [Darin](https://anilist.co/character/43301/Kurumiya-Darin-Arnschent) despite her intentions to use Rea as a research subject. She calls [Mero](https://anilist.co/character/36497/Furuya-Mero) by Mero-Chan similar to that of [Mero's mother](https://anilist.co/character/64031/Furuya-Yuzuna) which causes Mero great discomfort at first. Similarly, she calls Darin with the -Chan suffix to Darin's discontent.\n\nShe likes Chihiro and feels like she is bothering or interrupting Chihiro and [Ranko](https://anilist.co/character/36496/Saouji-Ranko)'s relationship. She seems to understand [Bābu](https://anilist.co/character/36495/Baabu). She's also physically strong as her body is no longer retrained by her brain as a result of her death.\n\n~!Rea is revealed to be a new, special case of zombification similar to that of [Chihiro's mother](https://anilist.co/character/64031/Furuya-Yuzuna). Instead of losing her humanity, her love for things turns into lust which leads to the state of \"Eater Confusion\". !~\n\n~!After Rea attempts to eat Chihiro out of lust at festival, she runs away and is tracked down at the abandoned hotel where Chihiro finds her two days later. She attempts to seal herself away in the well but Chihiro drags her out, and she once again attempts to eat him due to the Eater Confusion status. After taking heavy blood loss from the wound he received from Rea, Chihiro confesses to Rea which returns her humanity in time for her to protect him from the collapsing roof. After these events both feel more awkward around each other, with Rea having difficulty just looking Chihiro in the eyes; blushing every time she sees him.!~",
        "gender": "Female",
        "age": "15"
      },
