        "description": "__Height__: 144 cm  \n__Class__: First Year Middle School Student\n\nChihiro's 12-year-old little sister. She likes to dress as a ghost and is quite expressionless. Despite this, she loves her brother very much and often teases him.    ~!When Furuya was bedridden due to Rea's attack at the festival, she is seen in a frenzy due to her brother's state.!~   ~!At the night of the barbeque, she teases her brother and sets up a test of courage in the forest. She partners up with Rea and explains that having watched Furuya for 12 years, she's relieved he found Rea.!~   ~!It is strongly hinted that her and Chihiro's mother was a zombie, and that she had to abandon them out of fear of eating them out of love. !~",
